WEBVTT

00:09.864 --> 00:14.869
[Ori]

00:16.392 --> 00:17.405
No way…

00:19.001 --> 00:21.024
Kanuma's an absolute wreck…

00:21.706 --> 00:23.615
Dude was just playing with him.

00:25.222 --> 00:26.940
Do you know who that guy is?

00:27.573 --> 00:28.297
Nope.

00:28.666 --> 00:30.765
So he's probably a first-year, too…

00:31.725 --> 00:33.798
Crap, Bofurin's bad news.

00:36.114 --> 00:37.889
Nice one, Suo!

00:38.994 --> 00:40.834
You're one tough customer!

00:42.422 --> 00:43.828
Oh, no, I'm not all that.

00:44.228 --> 00:46.883
Suo! Was that kung-fu!?

00:47.070 --> 00:48.750
Or was it aikido or something?

00:49.047 --> 00:50.190
Hmm…

00:51.074 --> 00:52.194
I don't really know.

00:52.369 --> 00:52.887
Huh!?

00:53.600 --> 00:57.238
My instructor was self-taught,
so it's a real mishmash.

00:57.798 --> 00:59.580
Th-That so…

01:00.118 --> 01:02.114
W-Wait, instructor!?

01:02.308 --> 01:03.272
That aside,

01:03.714 --> 01:07.085
I was surprised to see that
even you can get emotional.

01:07.340 --> 01:11.489
Man, I'm a little embarrassed.
I'm not normally like that,

01:13.561 --> 01:15.615
but Sakura rubbed off on me.

01:16.609 --> 01:17.996
Don't blame me, dude.

01:18.758 --> 01:21.721
Also… When we fight, you better take it serious.

01:22.110 --> 01:23.840
Again with that?

01:24.198 --> 01:26.243
Is that all you ever think about?

01:26.377 --> 01:29.036
I dunno, Sakura, you can be a real pain.

01:29.337 --> 01:30.921
I don't wanna fight you.

01:31.085 --> 01:34.019
A pain, am I!? A pain!?

01:34.020 --> 01:35.596
Sakura, calm down!

01:35.600 --> 01:36.441
Let go!

01:36.506 --> 01:37.994
- No!
- Look at them, all rubbing off on each other.

01:37.994 --> 01:39.485
- Get off, dumbass!
- Look at them, all rubbing off on each other.

01:39.634 --> 01:40.487
You wanna go?!

01:40.490 --> 01:42.815
Outside influences sure are valuable.

01:45.908 --> 01:48.700
I didn't forget about you
calling me stupid, either!

01:48.815 --> 01:50.906
Wow, nice memory.

01:50.910 --> 01:53.493
- You son of a bitch!
- Sakura, come on, calm down!

01:54.057 --> 01:56.217
They'll make a great team.

02:18.472 --> 02:20.140
Ka… numa…

02:36.160 --> 02:38.914
They got you, too, huh?

02:40.514 --> 02:41.196
…ver…

02:43.299 --> 02:44.148
It's over.

02:44.918 --> 02:45.626
Over.

02:46.624 --> 02:47.520
We're…

02:48.529 --> 02:49.516
done for.

02:53.535 --> 02:54.670
Lucky!

02:55.062 --> 02:56.918
Hey, I also wanna fight Patc…

02:56.918 --> 02:58.920
Alright, next.

03:00.895 --> 03:02.830
Who'll we have next?

03:03.782 --> 03:05.420
It's finally my turn.

03:09.767 --> 03:10.205
Hm?

03:16.171 --> 03:16.727
Eh?

03:17.222 --> 03:17.798
Huh?!

03:23.691 --> 03:24.807
Sorry, Sakura.

03:25.695 --> 03:26.681
I'm going first.

03:26.979 --> 03:28.205
Wait a damn minute!

03:28.563 --> 03:31.539
It's first-years first! Why do I gotta go later!?

03:31.540 --> 03:32.845
S-Sakura!

03:33.139 --> 03:35.131
You're fighting Togame, yeah?

03:35.699 --> 03:37.801
Doesn't look like he wants to go yet.

03:43.241 --> 03:44.720
He's second in command.

03:45.051 --> 03:47.820
Normally it'd be me against him, but…

03:48.007 --> 03:49.310
You sayin' I can't win!?

03:50.049 --> 03:51.123
No, I'm not.

03:53.104 --> 03:53.813
You got this.

03:57.040 --> 04:01.100
I-I don't need you to say that!
I was gonna fight and win, anyway!

04:01.466 --> 04:03.436
And what's with Squinty there!?

04:03.634 --> 04:04.830
Dude's buttin' in line!

04:05.546 --> 04:07.744
Maybe those two know each other.

04:08.224 --> 04:10.190
Yeah, that's probably right.

04:10.426 --> 04:14.826
Hiragi doesn't talk about himself very much.

04:15.664 --> 04:20.457
But hey, it makes sense
he'd know some people from outside Furin.

04:23.493 --> 04:26.758
Do your best, Sako!

04:28.030 --> 04:29.295
Sako…

04:30.537 --> 04:34.586
I never thought I'd see the day
you'd ask for a one-on-one.

04:36.472 --> 04:39.782
Something happen between you and Hiragi?

04:45.611 --> 04:48.491
I never can tell what that guy's thinking.

04:48.655 --> 04:49.721
Yeah, but hey!

04:50.015 --> 04:54.998
I'm real excited to get to see Sako face off
against one of Bofurin's four devas!

04:56.567 --> 04:58.220
It's been a while, Sako.

04:58.944 --> 05:00.289
You've grown.

05:04.533 --> 05:06.434
So you're in Lion's Head now, huh…

05:07.801 --> 05:09.699
Guess there was no avoiding this.

05:12.727 --> 05:16.186
Sorry, bud, but I'm gonna win.

06:55.177 --> 06:57.935
Come on! Enough talking!

06:58.320 --> 07:00.483
Go! Get to the fighting!

07:26.007 --> 07:27.832
"Sorry, bud, but I'm gonna win"?

07:28.586 --> 07:31.428
You're still looking down on me.

07:32.769 --> 07:34.144
You disgust me.

07:35.272 --> 07:36.982
The version of me you knew…

07:37.809 --> 07:39.089
is gone.

07:41.207 --> 07:43.024
And I'll prove it to you.

07:56.838 --> 07:57.386
He just…?!

08:00.278 --> 08:01.954
- Yeah, Sako!
- Kill him!

08:02.194 --> 08:04.411
H-Hiragi's on the defensive!

08:04.811 --> 08:05.809
This is bad!

08:06.060 --> 08:07.737
Doin' great, Sako!

08:07.801 --> 08:09.276
Keep it up!

08:09.318 --> 08:10.491
Wow…

08:10.838 --> 08:12.800
He's a good fighter,

08:12.994 --> 08:14.533
that Sako.

08:15.089 --> 08:18.403
Well, duh. He's one of my five fingers.

08:18.773 --> 08:21.706
He's an even match for 'Ragi.

08:23.451 --> 08:27.295
Well, I may not be able
to tell what he's thinking,

08:28.102 --> 08:30.906
but he's fought more than anyone.

08:31.820 --> 08:35.808
Damn near burnt himself out when he first joined.

08:36.316 --> 08:39.313
That reminds me, Sako's not much of a talker, huh.

08:39.664 --> 08:42.414
Usually only gives one-word responses. Yes, no.

08:42.826 --> 08:44.010
He sure does.

08:44.659 --> 08:47.908
That just shows how much he thinks of Hiragi.

08:49.961 --> 08:51.405
Straightforward.

08:53.546 --> 08:55.401
Relying on power alone.

08:56.681 --> 08:57.965
Template as hell.

08:58.563 --> 09:00.834
Utterly devoid of originality!

09:06.556 --> 09:08.914
You haven't changed one bit.

09:09.836 --> 09:12.308
And you've turned into a real talker.

09:13.500 --> 09:17.798
I never had to tell you to keep quiet
so you didn't bite your tongue in a fight.

09:18.045 --> 09:19.447
You never talked.

09:23.320 --> 09:24.952
What?! He sped up?!

09:39.645 --> 09:42.323
Maybe you have changed. You got weaker.

09:44.803 --> 09:47.916
This is what happens when you
hang with people like them.

09:49.291 --> 09:51.664
Just a naive bunch of buddy-buddy kids…

09:51.786 --> 09:52.438
Hey!

09:52.716 --> 09:53.321
Huh?

09:53.459 --> 09:54.556
Not you.

09:55.512 --> 09:58.129
I'm talkin' to you, Fangy! You listenin'!?

09:58.476 --> 10:01.283
He's lookin' down on us because of you!

10:01.401 --> 10:03.791
- You're acting as weak as your damn stomach!

10:03.791 --> 10:05.108
- Wait, Sakura!
- You're acting as weak as your damn stomach!

10:06.586 --> 10:09.123
What are you laughing about, Suo?!

10:09.196 --> 10:15.470
Oh, sorry. I was just thinking that Sakura's
starting to care about his friends.

10:15.965 --> 10:19.622
Huh!? I was just pissed about
that guy making fun of us!

10:19.920 --> 10:22.049
Mm-hm. I bet you were.

10:22.380 --> 10:24.453
Let's just calm down, Sakura.

10:25.939 --> 10:27.321
Sako, was it?

10:29.272 --> 10:32.979
Hiragi's one of Bofurin's four devas, you know.

10:33.443 --> 10:37.306
Specifically he's our Tamon. The head.

10:38.944 --> 10:42.125
Do you know Tamon's other name?

10:42.822 --> 10:43.744
Huh?

10:47.382 --> 10:50.586
Man, I haven't taken a kick like that in ages.

10:50.830 --> 10:51.744
I felt that one.

11:01.203 --> 11:04.300
That said, I musta looked real lame.

11:05.520 --> 11:09.550
You've gotten way stronger.
Like a whole different person.

11:10.392 --> 11:13.782
Tamon is also known as Bishamonten.

11:14.118 --> 11:16.590
A warrior god who governs combat.

11:17.508 --> 11:19.596
Even got a first-year yelling at me.

11:19.859 --> 11:21.253
Talk about embarrassing.

11:21.847 --> 11:23.996
These meds can't handle that.

11:24.582 --> 11:27.367
But hey, this is getting fun.

11:56.148 --> 11:59.539
Don't get all full of yourself
just because you're smart.

12:01.123 --> 12:02.434
Damn brat.

12:02.567 --> 12:05.828
But… I didn't even do anything.

12:05.965 --> 12:08.609
- I'm not getting full of…
- That's what pisses us off!

12:12.708 --> 12:14.411
What a weakling!

12:14.624 --> 12:16.807
Just shut your mouth, wimp!

12:16.902 --> 12:18.613
What do you think you're doing?

12:33.836 --> 12:34.609
Whoa, man…

12:35.104 --> 12:38.007
You don't see duels like this every day!

12:39.645 --> 12:40.708
Incredible.

12:41.500 --> 12:44.259
What gives? He's so strong!

12:44.636 --> 12:47.779
Well, yeah. Bofurin's four devas earn their spots.

12:48.167 --> 12:50.480
Everyone in town knows how strong they are.

12:52.262 --> 12:54.598
Well, he should have acted like it!

12:54.960 --> 12:57.744
Well, hey. Even if he was strong to begin with,

12:58.007 --> 13:00.662
I'm pretty sure you still riled him up.

13:14.060 --> 13:17.276
This is great! Great! Sako's so strong!

13:17.382 --> 13:18.640
He sure is.

13:19.664 --> 13:20.876
But, y'know…

13:21.626 --> 13:23.706
Hiragi has the upper hand now.

13:28.449 --> 13:29.390
Dammit…

13:29.961 --> 13:32.499
You shouldn't still be stronger than me!

13:33.203 --> 13:34.247
How could you!?

13:34.876 --> 13:38.636
You've been living the easy life with those guys!

13:39.554 --> 13:41.146
So why…?!

13:42.666 --> 13:44.407
Wh-Why…?

13:45.920 --> 13:49.912
What do you mean, why?
They were picking on a weakling.

13:51.120 --> 13:52.925
Should I have let them?

13:53.824 --> 13:58.091
You gotta learn. Staying quiet
just gets these types madder.

13:58.678 --> 13:59.874
Fight back a little.

14:01.120 --> 14:01.939
Need a hand?

14:08.106 --> 14:10.674
Teach me how to fight!

14:12.316 --> 14:13.672
O-Okay…

14:16.213 --> 14:18.552
You were crazy strong back then…

14:19.680 --> 14:22.022
Even though you didn't try to make one,

14:22.579 --> 14:25.005
a pack formed around you naturally.

14:26.190 --> 14:28.803
I deeply respected you from the moment we met.

14:29.809 --> 14:34.445
From the bottom of my heart,
I was proud to follow you.

14:37.207 --> 14:40.083
Hiragi! Congratulations!

14:40.472 --> 14:41.942
Finally advancing to Furin?

14:42.293 --> 14:42.986
Yup.

14:43.295 --> 14:45.420
I bet you can be top dog there!

14:45.866 --> 14:48.601
You deserve to stand above everyone!

14:49.207 --> 14:52.377
And I'll do whatever it takes to make sure you do!

14:53.097 --> 14:55.992
I'll enter Furin next year and help you!

14:56.620 --> 15:01.481
You would be top dog
at the yet-to-be-unified Furin.

15:02.540 --> 15:05.680
That's what I earnestly believed.

15:06.659 --> 15:07.680
Hey, Sako.

15:10.487 --> 15:12.331
You shouldn't follow me.

15:14.148 --> 15:14.975
What…?

15:16.297 --> 15:19.504
I'm gonna be under a guy named Umemiya at Furin.

15:20.396 --> 15:22.495
So I won't be top dog.

15:23.550 --> 15:27.184
Even if you follow me,
I can't meet your expectations.

15:29.984 --> 15:33.405
You should find yourself a new goal.

15:38.807 --> 15:39.619
Why…?

15:49.691 --> 15:52.979
Wow. You do all this yourself?

15:53.287 --> 15:54.693
You're a strong one.

15:56.590 --> 15:59.165
How about joining our team?

15:59.401 --> 16:00.929
Fight me, too!

16:02.990 --> 16:04.434
Do you have strong guys?

16:04.834 --> 16:06.308
But of course.

16:06.670 --> 16:07.908
I'm strong, too!

16:08.304 --> 16:11.931
We believe that strength is everything.

16:12.502 --> 16:14.499
We accept the strong.

16:14.979 --> 16:18.529
The stronger you are, the higher you can go.

16:19.306 --> 16:20.925
I don't care about that.

16:22.030 --> 16:24.910
I only care about getting to fight strong people.

16:26.186 --> 16:27.295
I'll get stronger,

16:28.278 --> 16:30.700
beat him, and make him regret it!

16:33.211 --> 16:34.697
No way can I lose!

16:35.241 --> 16:38.198
Unlike you, I haven't been making friends!

16:38.426 --> 16:40.411
I've just been getting stronger!

16:42.620 --> 16:43.329
From below?!

16:55.916 --> 16:57.318
I can't lose…

16:59.885 --> 17:04.198
I can't lose to a guy who's
satisfied to be under someone else!

17:07.775 --> 17:08.548
Sako.

17:09.858 --> 17:13.440
I'm sorry I couldn't meet your expectations.

17:27.066 --> 17:28.125
That's not it…

17:29.367 --> 17:30.335
I'm sorry.

17:31.020 --> 17:32.316
That's not it!

17:32.963 --> 17:36.948
You don't have anything to apologize for!

17:39.100 --> 17:42.228
I'm gonna be under a guy named Umemiya at Furin.

17:43.363 --> 17:45.497
So I won't be top dog.

17:46.620 --> 17:50.293
Even if you follow me,
I can't meet your expectations.

17:51.455 --> 17:55.295
I knew you were looking out for me.

17:56.251 --> 17:56.891
But still…

17:57.805 --> 17:59.603
You shouldn't follow me.

18:00.110 --> 18:02.232
That wasn't what I wanted to hear.

18:03.017 --> 18:06.628
You should find yourself a new goal.

18:07.447 --> 18:09.500
I know I was being selfish.

18:10.510 --> 18:11.405
But still…

18:11.961 --> 18:13.958
You were always my goal.

18:15.100 --> 18:19.211
I didn't care who you were under, or where.

18:20.312 --> 18:21.226
I just wanted…

18:22.205 --> 18:26.342
for you to tell me to follow you.

18:52.921 --> 18:53.923
Hiragi…

18:55.055 --> 18:58.274
I'm going to follow you forever.

18:58.750 --> 18:59.977
Where'd that come from?

19:00.380 --> 19:02.133
I've made up my mind.

19:02.655 --> 19:04.746
You belong on top.

19:05.520 --> 19:10.022
Even on your way up, and after
you're top dog, I'll be right behind you!

19:10.803 --> 19:12.224
That's what I've decided.

19:21.611 --> 19:22.906
Wh-Whoa…

19:23.097 --> 19:24.091
No way…

19:24.533 --> 19:26.697
S-Sako lost?

19:27.920 --> 19:31.912
That's Hiragi Toma, one of Bofurin's four devas…

19:33.638 --> 19:37.020
Wow, what a fight that was.

19:42.030 --> 19:45.177
Aww, Sako went and lost.

19:45.630 --> 19:47.653
'Ragi sure is strong, huh!

19:47.866 --> 19:49.093
I wanna fight him, too!

19:52.186 --> 19:56.937
Somebody, I don't care who,
get him down from there.

20:00.731 --> 20:01.500
No need.

20:03.699 --> 20:04.841
I'll get him down.

20:16.838 --> 20:19.706
Hey, thanks, man.

20:20.335 --> 20:24.125
But really, you didn't have to
be so gentle with him.

20:25.699 --> 20:27.900
Alright, been nice knowin' ya.

20:29.512 --> 20:30.320
What?

20:31.062 --> 20:35.820
Why not wait to handle that
until after your match?

20:38.026 --> 20:41.805
You never know what'll happen, after all.

20:45.283 --> 20:47.573
And what do you mean by that?

20:48.213 --> 20:49.287
Who knows.

20:50.780 --> 20:54.076
But, well, this is just me talkin' to myself,

20:55.493 --> 20:59.942
but I don't think doin' things like this
will make your team stronger.

21:01.626 --> 21:03.592
You talk to yourself real loud.

21:04.430 --> 21:06.240
So you actually have it in you.

21:07.234 --> 21:08.590
G-Great work!

21:09.276 --> 21:10.213
Nicely done.

21:12.354 --> 21:15.493
I can't bring myself to ask about his opponent…

21:17.257 --> 21:18.026
Nice job.

21:19.116 --> 21:19.672
Yup.

21:20.003 --> 21:23.200
Your roundhouse kicks are
always a sight to behold!

21:23.436 --> 21:25.055
I sure don't want to take one!

21:26.304 --> 21:27.219
Not gonna ask?

21:27.512 --> 21:28.308
Ask what?

21:29.836 --> 21:31.520
Who he was.

21:32.259 --> 21:33.691
Or what went down.

21:35.112 --> 21:37.009
Did you want to talk about it?

21:38.293 --> 21:40.514
No, not really…

21:41.329 --> 21:43.093
Then I don't wanna ask.

21:44.110 --> 21:46.392
You can tell me when you feel like it.

21:47.782 --> 21:49.721
That's when I'll want to hear it.

21:54.967 --> 21:55.740
Got it.

21:57.003 --> 22:00.006
[#06: Chasing His Back]

23:30.685 --> 23:35.504
Everyone in Lion's Head wears matching jumpers!
It really makes them feel like a team!

23:36.106 --> 23:38.213
Hmph. I don't like 'em.

23:38.300 --> 23:39.386
You're kidding!

23:39.904 --> 23:41.497
Jumpers are great!

23:41.916 --> 23:43.070
Did you know?

23:43.188 --> 23:48.000
They originated as souvenir jackets
made for soldiers in Yokosuka!

23:48.373 --> 23:52.186
That's why so many have
oriental dragon and tiger designs!

23:55.020 --> 23:58.449
Looks like I hit a nerve.
